# Files that live in this repo but must never be served by the APEX project
# (fluxcompute.dev, Root Directory = repo root).
#
# Verified before this existed: fluxcompute.dev/SKILL.md and
# fluxcompute.dev/docs/superpowers/plans/*.md both returned 200.
internal/
SKILL.md
Design System.html
README.md
scripts/

# docs/ is served by its own Vercel project (docs.fluxcompute.dev, Root
# Directory = docs/), so the apex must NOT also publish it — those pages use
# root-relative /docs.css and /routing.html, which only resolve on the docs
# host, and would render unstyled with dead links at fluxcompute.dev/docs/*.
#
# This line is safe for the docs project only because docs/.vercelignore
# exists: Vercel uses the Root Directory's .vercelignore when there is one and
# falls back to this file when there isn't. Without that file, this line would
# strip the docs project's entire content. Do not delete docs/.vercelignore.
docs/
